# Browser
# What a player sees of Dauntless Bodyguard's "As this creature enters, choose another creature you control" (CR 614.12a):
# as it enters, Bot1's page asks for a creature, captioned as the choice it is - not a target, and nothing happens to it
# now - and Bot1 clicks Ornithopter, Birds of Paradise also offered. The Bodyguard then wears the creature it chose over its
# art, as a permanent shows any one quality chosen as it entered (CR 607.2d).

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Black Lotus
Ornithopter
Birds of Paradise
Dauntless Bodyguard
Island
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Birds of Paradise.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Dauntless Bodyguard.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Client.Bot1.Prompt.Title = Dauntless Bodyguard: choose a creature as it enters
Bot1.Choose(Ornithopter)
[T1 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Dauntless Bodyguard.ChosenObject = Ornithopter
Client.Bot1.Battlefield.Dauntless Bodyguard.Annotation = Ornithopter
